1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,847
All caps on a school website.

2
00:00:03,131 --> 00:00:04,428
Looks like a detail.

3
00:00:04,478 --> 00:00:06,980
Now multiply it by a thousand schools.

4
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:16,564
Every school has the same duties: accessibility, data protection, security, and rules that keep changing.

5
00:00:17,046 --> 00:00:20,967
Most face them alone, with their own budget and their own contractor.

6
00:00:21,017 --> 00:00:23,089
So quality comes down to chance.

7
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,965
Cleverphant is shared digital infrastructure for schools.

8
00:00:29,121 --> 00:00:31,357
What people see is the website.

9
00:00:31,641 --> 00:00:38,313
Underneath is everything that keeps it right, from one design system to compliance and support, shared by every school.

10
00:00:38,363 --> 00:00:40,447
A new school simply plugs in.

11
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:48,543
Because every school runs on the same system, they all get the same benefits, and the same bugs.

12
00:00:48,699 --> 00:00:51,041
But it takes just one school to notice.

13
00:00:51,091 --> 00:00:53,187
Fixed once, fixed for all.

14
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:57,723
Ideas travel the same way.

15
00:00:57,810 --> 00:01:00,314
A curious school leader brings a need.

16
00:01:00,364 --> 00:01:02,402
Their school becomes the pilot.

17
00:01:02,791 --> 00:01:06,988
When the data shows it works, it becomes the standard for every school.

18
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:11,665
And it works from the top, too.

19
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:20,013
A municipality or a ministry publishes a new rule or a campaign once, and it appears on every school website at the same time.

20
00:01:22,650 --> 00:01:26,336
A small village school gets what a large city school gets.

21
00:01:26,551 --> 00:01:29,749
A family changing schools finds a familiar place.

22
00:01:30,138 --> 00:01:34,174
One design system underneath; the face stays the school's own.

23
00:01:34,224 --> 00:01:35,289
Not identical.

24
00:01:35,339 --> 00:01:36,460
Equally good.

25
00:01:39,150 --> 00:01:41,120
Change starts with details.

26
00:01:41,170 --> 00:01:43,824
Being small is no excuse to look away.

27
00:01:44,038 --> 00:01:51,149
Stop writing in capitals, stop stretching text, stop hiding information in images, get cookie consent right.

28
00:01:51,236 --> 00:01:53,634
That's our Trojan elephant, in the good sense.

29
00:01:53,790 --> 00:02:05,151
Once it works everywhere, every next step lands on every school: live tables, whistleblower channels, consultation booking, surveys, event calendars, update subscriptions.

30
00:02:07,650 --> 00:02:09,827
And we keep asking: what if?

31
00:02:09,983 --> 00:02:14,808
What if a teacher's Word file became a finished article, and she just clicked approve?

32
00:02:15,289 --> 00:02:18,639
What if documents named, dated and filed themselves?

33
00:02:18,923 --> 00:02:23,039
What if the website noticed what's outdated, and asked you once a month?

34
00:02:23,254 --> 00:02:26,046
What if a fix was ready before you saw the problem?

35
00:02:26,435 --> 00:02:28,428
None of this needs a new website.

36
00:02:28,478 --> 00:02:31,294
Each idea is an app on the same foundation.

37
00:02:31,508 --> 00:02:34,545
One school pilots it, every school gets it.

38
00:02:37,150 --> 00:02:38,295
And AI?

39
00:02:38,345 --> 00:02:39,791
Not another chatbot.

40
00:02:40,006 --> 00:02:42,312
AI that quietly keeps things in order.

41
00:02:42,362 --> 00:02:44,319
Because AI loves order.

42
00:02:46,650 --> 00:02:51,845
What works in one school works in a municipality, a region, a whole country.

43
00:02:52,129 --> 00:02:56,245
Schools can be added quickly, while costs grow far more slowly.

44
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:57,952
Not a promise of cheap.

45
00:02:58,108 --> 00:02:59,600
The logic of scale.

46
00:03:02,150 --> 00:03:04,677
We have walked this road for fifteen years.

47
00:03:04,727 --> 00:03:12,674
Hundreds of institutions, whole municipalities on one standard, with content audits, proven onboarding and a training platform.

48
00:03:13,156 --> 00:03:14,845
Built in a small country.

49
00:03:15,129 --> 00:03:16,343
Ready for yours.

50
00:03:16,732 --> 00:03:18,444
Let's talk about your region.
